<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">Your account is temporarily locked</h1>
  <p>
    There were too many failed sign-in attempts for
    <strong><%= h(user.email) %></strong>, so we locked the account for
    <%= lock_minutes %> minutes.
  </p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px;">
    If that was you, wait for the lock to expire and try again — or reset your
    password if you have forgotten it. If it wasn't you, someone is guessing
    your password: the attempts failed, but a stronger password is a good idea.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="<%= reset_url %>"
       style="background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
      Reset your password
    </a>
  </p>
</div>
